    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/4637df18bb8b3f07464450b0405782b6.avif?t=1748293497\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span><strong>Seagulls: Crappy Situation</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded at sea and surrounded by angry seagulls, you must survive endless waves using only a slingshot and water hose. Test your multitasking and strategy skills in this quirky, rogue-lite game with local co-op. Get ready for hilarious chaos and bizarre seagulls!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea3\u200d Survive the Seagull Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your raft from waves of seagulls. Shoot them down with your slingshot, but watch out\u2014those birds leave a <i>nasty mess</i>. The more you fail, the more you learn!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc6b<strong>Local Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend for split-screen co-op and tackle the bird madness together! It\u2019s more chaotic and way more fun with teammates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04<strong>\u00a0Rogue-lite elements </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two waves are the same! Random upgrades and play styles make each run unique. Will you survive longer? Try new strategies and adapt to the chaos!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>\u00a0Aim, Shoot, Upgrade Your Raft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy to learn, but seagulls get tougher with each wave. Aim carefully, protect your raft, and collect resources to reinforce it. Unlock  upgrades or find scrap and to survive tougher waves\u2014stronger rafts last longer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebf Clean Up the Poop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seagull droppings pile up quickly! Use your water hose to clean up the mess, or risk your raft falling apart. Keep it clean to stay afloat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd3f Explore the depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive beneath the waves to explore shipwrecks and gather scrap to reinforce your raft. Use the wreckage to upgrade your defenses and keep your raft afloat as the seagull attacks intensify!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/f64a578cb2c5010a6e9b32f2b464cfe9.avif?t=1748293497\" width=600 height=228 /></span><strong><i>No seagulls were hurt during this production.</i></strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/4637df18bb8b3f07464450b0405782b6.avif?t=1748293497\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span><strong>Seagulls: Crappy Situation</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded at sea and surrounded by angry seagulls, you must survive endless waves using only a slingshot and water hose. Test your multitasking and strategy skills in this quirky, rogue-lite game with local co-op. Get ready for hilarious chaos and bizarre seagulls!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea3\u200d Survive the Seagull Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your raft from waves of seagulls. Shoot them down with your slingshot, but watch out\u2014those birds leave a <i>nasty mess</i>. The more you fail, the more you learn!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc6b<strong>Local Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend for split-screen co-op and tackle the bird madness together! It\u2019s more chaotic and way more fun with teammates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd04<strong>\u00a0Rogue-lite elements </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two waves are the same! Random upgrades and play styles make each run unique. Will you survive longer? Try new strategies and adapt to the chaos!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>\u00a0Aim, Shoot, Upgrade Your Raft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy to learn, but seagulls get tougher with each wave. Aim carefully, protect your raft, and collect resources to reinforce it. Unlock  upgrades or find scrap and to survive tougher waves\u2014stronger rafts last longer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udebf Clean Up the Poop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seagull droppings pile up quickly! Use your water hose to clean up the mess, or risk your raft falling apart. Keep it clean to stay afloat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd3f Explore the depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive beneath the waves to explore shipwrecks and gather scrap to reinforce your raft. Use the wreckage to upgrade your defenses and keep your raft afloat as the seagull attacks intensify!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.poster.avif?t=1748293497\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.webm?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.mp4?t=1748293497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/f64a578cb2c5010a6e9b32f2b464cfe9.avif?t=1748293497\" width=600 height=228 /></span><strong><i>No seagulls were hurt during this production.</i></strong> </p>",
